================================================================================
3. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL - not licensed by this repository
================================================================================

Some of what the code operates on, and some of what the derived tables are
computed from, is not mine to license. Specifically:

  - Natan Alterman's texts are distributed by Project Ben-Yehuda as
    `by_permission`, not as public domain. His running text is NOT in this
    repository. The derived tables over it - the metadata index, frequency
    lists, topic weights, entity counts and CNLL word lists - are aggregate
    statistics, and nothing here grants any right in the underlying texts,
    which remain with their rights holders.

  - Ahad Ha'am's writings are public domain. His running text is also not in
    this repository; it is rebuilt from the Project Ben-Yehuda public domain
    dump by the scripts in data/corpus/.

  - The Hebrew NRC-VAD lexicon is not distributed here and remains under NRC's
    own terms. See "Running it" in README.md for where to obtain it.

  - The models used (DictaBERT, DictaLM, hebrew-gpt_neo, HeBERT) are each under
    their own licenses on the Hugging Face Hub.


